sequenceDiagram
    participant C as ChatGPT MCP client
    participant CP as Control plane
    participant J as Jazz remoteCalls
    participant D as MCPDevice
    participant DC as Desktop Commander

    C->>CP: call_device_tool / ping / reconnect / shutdown
    CP->>CP: verify OAuth subject + device ownership + heartbeat
    CP->>J: insert pending remoteCall
    J-->>D: pending-row subscription event
    D->>CP: POST claim(callId, deviceId)
    CP->>J: pending -> executing
    CP-->>D: claimed=true
    D->>DC: execute local MCP tool
    DC-->>D: result / error
    D->>CP: POST completion
    CP->>J: executing -> completed/failed
    J-->>CP: terminal row observed
    CP-->>C: durable result

    Note over D,DC: Local side effect begins only after authority claim.
    Note over CP,J: Idempotency key can converge duplicate requests.
    Note over D,CP: Planned hardening: separate effect execution from result-reporting uncertainty.
